flowchart TD
  Start((Start)) --> Auth[Register / Authenticate Candidate]
  Auth --> Device[Select Monitoring Mode and Run Device Checks]
  Device --> Exam[Start Examination Session]
  Exam --> Evidence[Generate Structured Evidence Events]
  Evidence --> CIE[CIE Contextual Assessment]
  CIE --> Agentic[Agentic Recommendation]
  Agentic --> IPIME[IPIME Policy Evaluation]
  IPIME --> Decision{Acknowledgement Required?}
  Decision -- No --> Continue[Continue Monitoring / Examination Flow]
  Decision -- Yes --> Ack[Candidate Incident Acknowledgement]
  Ack --> Review[Human Reviewer Inspects Evidence]
  Continue --> Final[Final Institutional Decision and Audit Report]
  Review --> Final
  Final --> End((End))
